Z||000000||sqoach||09-14-2001||01:06 AM||||Not sure if this has been covered, but I am definately curious the opinions of the members. I'm 19, not a full-time student, not married, so I will definately be a candidate if the Draft is put into effect. My mom is terrified that I might get thrown into the mix. I hate seeing her scared, and confused. I don't know what to think of it. I want these people to pay for what they did. But, I don't see myself picking up a gun and killing another life. It's definately against my religion. Give me your thoughts on this, please.<P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">         <BR>^^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^^<BR><LI><FONT SIZE="1">84 SE (FOR SALE)*sale pending*<BR><LI>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR><LI>86 SC (FOR SALE)</FONT>||||reg||5
